<title>FRANCE: Details of latest EU grain export/import balance.</title>
<headline>Details of latest EU grain export/import balance.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following are details of EU grain export/import commitments between July 1 and September 10 of the 1996/97 (July/June) campaign supplied by member country officials. Since the figures were drawn up, the EU has granted exports of 27,300 tonnes of soft wheat, 423,185 tonnes of barley, 26,809 tonnes of rye and 5,100 tonnes of oats.</p>
<p>Figures (000 tonnes) are based on officially communicated certificates and are subject to revision.</p>
<p>			 ---------1996/97-------  ------1995/96-------</p>
<p>			     1Jul96 to 10Sept96   1Jul95 to 10Sept 95</p>
<p>			 EXPORTS  PCT(1) IMPORTS  EXPORTS    IMPORTS</p>
<p> Soft wheat(grain)    713     31	119    2,305	  635</p>
<p>  Flour (2)	     945     79	  2    1,194	    0</p>
<p>Food aid</p>
<p>    - grain	     211    126	  0	167	    0</p>
